= Appendix

== Further Reading


Of the sources listed in the @BIBLIOGRAPHY section, certain entries are especially useful:

#[
  #set cite(form: "full")
  - @PROFESSIONAL_BAKING: This is a comprehensive textbook on the art of professional
    baking. The only thing it could have a little more of is recipes, but if what you're
    looking for is knowledge or technique, I'd highly recommend.

  - @KABC_CHART: Comprehensive chart comparing typical imperial volumes to typical
    imperial & metric weights. Do be careful while referencing this chart (or any King
    Arthur recipe, for that matter): for some odd reason, they use Canadian cups, which
    are slightly smaller than American cups (227.3 mℓ vs. 236.6 mℓ).

    Also, King Arthur Baking has good recipes in general. I get their newsletter. It's
    cool.
]
